            judged by real-world performance while building. A survey found XState, Zustand, Redux, RTK and
            redux-persist cap no size or queue; they guard loops (XState `maxIterations`, Redux's re-entrancy throw) and
            slow work (RTK's `warnAfter`, 32 ms).

            **Read first:** @plan.Pending.D23, @plan.Pending.D24, @spec.Actors (the 1,024 mailbox, the follow-up cap),
            @spec.WriteLanes (serialize's 64, the `many` key), @spec.WriteAhead (scope bounds), @spec.Compile (name
            bytes), @spec.Diagnostics, code:wiki/conventions/fixtures.md.

